<title>USA: American Standard sets $100 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>American Standard sets $100 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Standard Cos Inc said its board approved the repurchase, from time to time in the open market, up to $100 million of company common stock over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>It is expected that shares repurchased under the plan will be available in connection with the exercise of stock options pursuant to American Standard's stock incentive plan and other incentive compensation programs.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610)).</p>
</text>
